# The packaged venv is complete and needs nothing beyond python3 (its
# cryptography and cffi wheels carry their own OpenSSL and libffi).  pip,
# venv, a compiler and the -dev headers are only for ensure-venv.sh's
# rebuild when this host's Python does not suit that venv, so they are
# Recommends: apt still installs them online, and dpkg -i on an air-gapped
# host no longer refuses the package for want of libffi-dev (2026-11-25).
Recommends: python3-pip,
 python3-venv,
 python3-dev,
 gcc,
 libffi-dev,
 libssl-dev
Suggests: genisoimage | mkisofs | xorriso,
 qemu-utils,
 virtinst,
 libvirt-clients
Description: System management agent for SysManage
 The SysManage agent provides comprehensive system management capabilities
 including:
  * Package inventory and updates
  * System monitoring and metrics
  * Security policy enforcement
  * Certificate management
  * Firewall configuration
  * Remote command execution
  * Integration with SysManage server
 .
 This agent runs as a system service and communicates securely with the
 SysManage server to provide centralized management of Linux systems.
